{
 "name": "warehouse_zoned_30",
 "description": "Zoned warehouse for the 30-AMR visual scenario. 12x6 grid of aisle intersections (66 m x 30 m), partitioned into 6 zones as 3 column bands x 2 row bands. Every aisle is a single lane driven either way, one AMR at a time from junction to junction, so no two robots ever meet head-on or pass abreast. Consignments are collected in the aisle itself, at a pickup midway along every interior pick-aisle segment (50), and dropped at stations off the right of the floor. Fits 8-bit node and edge ids.",
